      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Good that you're taking this on!\r\nBefore we leave, let me tell you what happened\r\nat the Mysree Barrow.",
        "Jp" : "よかった、引き受けてくれるのね！\r\nそれじゃあ、出発前に《ミスリウ古墳墓》で\r\n何が起こったかを話しておくわね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 446149,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The other day, a historian entered that tomb.\r\nThey had my permission, of course...\r\nbut while researching inside, they were attacked\r\nby a monster.",
        "Jp" : "先日、あの古墳墓に歴史家が立ち入ったのよ\r\nもちろん、私の許可を得てのことだったんだけど――\r\n中で調べ事をしている時に、魔物に襲われたらしいの"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482165,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "They barely escaped with their lives, but their\r\nrecollection is oddly vague.",
        "Jp" : "何とか命からがら逃げてきたみたいだけど\r\nどうにも言っていることがはっきりしないのよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482166,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The tomb was poorly lit... \r\nmaking it impossible to see the monster\r\nambushing them after dropping their lantern.",
        "Jp" : "――薄暗い古墳墓の中で突然飛びかかられて\r\nその瞬間にランタンを落としてしまったから\r\nどんな魔物だったかわからない――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482167,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "They recalled flailing their arms in desperation\r\nduring the ambush, but couldn't manage\r\nany contact with their attacker...\r\nNot even a hair, they said.",
        "Jp" : "――飛びかかられた瞬間に\r\n両腕を振り回して抵抗したものの\r\n魔物の毛一本掴むことができなかった――ですって"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482168,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "We have no idea what monster is lurking within\r\nthe tombs, so please exercise caution.",
        "Jp" : "何かの魔物がいることは間違いないと思うんだけど\r\n古墳墓の中に何が潜んでいるかはわからないから\r\nくれぐれも注意してね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482169,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
