      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I'm not rushing you, I'm just concerned.\r\nLet me know as soon as you find anything.",
        "Jp" : "急ぐわけじゃないけど気がかりなのよ\r\n何かわかったら、すぐ教えてね"
