      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As it turns out, the Shadow Chimera was the\r\nso-called \"mysterious monster\" all along!",
        "Jp" : "それにしても、シャドーキメラが\r\n\"得体の知れない魔物\"の正体とはね！"
