      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It makes sense. They are very difficult to see in\r\ndim light, and its fur is immaterial...\r\nI even started wondering what sort of\r\npowerful monster was lurking there!",
